  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Storage_Buildings?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><b>Storage buildings</b> are building where players can store all the items they collect or harvest in the game.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Types of buildings</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Silo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Barn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tackle Box\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>There are three different storage buildings:\n</p>\n<ul><li>the silo, which is used to store <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a></li>\n<li>the barn, which is used to store <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal goods</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a></li>\n<li>the tackle box, which is used to store <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing nets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-net-16940\" title=\"Mystery Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery nets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster traps</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-trap-17075\" title=\"Duck Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duck traps</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>The silo and the barn are located on the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a>. They are unlocked at level 1. They can be repaired for free.\n</p><p>The tackle box is located near the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a>. It is unlocked at level 27. It is given for free and does not need to be repaired.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Barn</a></i>\n</p><p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Silo</a></i>\n</p><p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tackle Box</a></i>\n</p><p>The silo and the barn can each hold 50 items initially, while the tackle box can hold 20.\n</p><p>All buildings can be upgraded using some <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>the silo and the tackle box can be upgraded using <a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nails</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/screw-6711\" title=\"Screw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">screws</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wood panels</a>.</li>\n<li>the barn can be upgraded using <a href=\"/wiki/bolt-3342\" title=\"Bolt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bolts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/duct-tape-2920\" title=\"Duct Tape\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duct tape</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/plank-3343\" title=\"Plank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">planks</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-farm-buildings-14843\" title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c2/Farmhouse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20160215111547\" title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-town-buildings-15140\" title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Town_Hall.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191026015915\" title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-fishing-lake-buildings-23358\" title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b4/Fishing_Hut.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150712181819\" title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831163812\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 322/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 950/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 340/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3835/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.988      1 -total\n 79.53%   17.488      1 Template:Navigation\n 60.29%   13.257      1 Template:BuildingsMenu\n  8.44%    1.856      1 Template:Languages\n  5.90%    1.297      1 Template:Clr\n  5.07%    1.115      3 Template:Main\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:3569-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831163812 and revision id 109550. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
